1752002458\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/746210/extras/599b53957e17c48f9a8f1357821b0347.webp?t=1752002458\" /></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play Remotely*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can use any Android or iOS device to join the game and play together! When playing with remote players, you can use any video streaming platform like Discord, Steam Broadcast, or Remote Play Together to connect with others! Just share your screen and invite your friends! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game is local multiplayer but can be enjoyed over streams with remote players. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Supported Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English, Brazilian Portuguese, and Spanish (Latam). More languages are coming soon! Please let us know your preferred language. </p>",
    "short_description": "Play with up to 8 players using phones as controllers! Play action minigames, strategy, drawing and other fun challenges with your friends, locally or online. No extra downloads needed! Turn any screen into a party with Play Together: Party Games!",
